# The deploy root is this directory, which also holds the pipeline and its
# inputs. Vercel does not read .gitignore, so without this it uploads the
# 1.2 GB of raw rasters and exports that live in data/ and fails on the
# 100 MB per-file limit.
#
# Nothing here is needed to serve the site: the app imports its generated
# JSON from src/app/data/, which IS deployed.

/data
/node_modules
/dist
/pipeline
__pycache__
*.pyc
.venv
*.tif
*.tif.gz
*.parquet
